  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Security constraint bypass when a collection lists\n     overlapping URL patterns\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-65182.patch: select the security constraint\n       with the longest matching path in RealmBase\n     - CVE-2026-65182\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Incorrect rewrite rule processing in RewriteValve\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-65927.patch: restart from the first rule on\n       the next flag, skip the remaining chained rules correctly when a\n       chain runs to the end of the rule set, do not append the original\n       query string with qsappend after a qsdiscard rule has matched, and\n       stop parsing the configuration on a read error\n     - CVE-2026-65927",
